# comet-ai
===
 A privacy-first, AI-native browser built with Electron & Next.js. Run local LLMs via Ollama or connect to Gemini/OpenAI. Features include AI page actions, E2EE sync, Chrome extension support, and a PDF study workspace. No tracking, fully open-source, and optimized for performance. Experience browsing where your data stays yours.@Comet-AI.
